    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nViewings suspended.\n\n \n\nREA MURPHY brings a 3-Bed, mid-terrace property to the open market for immediate sale. Located in a quiet cul-de-sac in the established Blessington Orchard development, this property is an ideal starter-home in Blessington Town.\n\nNo. 39 Blessington Orchard is a family home with a number of appealing features to be enjoyed. The internal layout gives a real sense of space and is very practical for the younger family. The rear garden is totally enclosed and child-friendly. \n\nBlessington Orchard is a short walk from Blessington Town centre and a choice of primary schools is available in the area. Blessington Community School is close by for secondary schooling and one can enjoy a full range of sporting and recreational clubs to choose from locally. Blessington Town offers an excellent quality of living with a strong emphasis on outdoor pursuits and of course the Blessington Lakes brings an added dimension, above all other comparable locations. \n\nAPPOINTMENT THROUGH REA MURPHY.\n\n \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nMain Living area: Awash with natural light. Feature bay-window and interconnecting doors to the Kitchen-living area. Finished with solid timber flooring and benefits from an open fireplace which is suitable for a wood-burning stove. \n\nKitchen with Dining area: A large open-plan living space with interconnecting doors to the Lounge. Fitted with a range of floor and eye-level units and finished with Tiled flooring. Free-standing Appliances are included in the sale. Access to the rear patio and gardens.\n\nDownstairs W.C: Toilet and WHB.\n\n1st Floor\n\nLanding: Hotpress and access to attic.\n\n1st Bedroom: Single Bedroom to the rear. Solid timber flooring.\n\n2nd Bedroom: Well-proportioned Double Bedroom. Solid timber flooring.\n\nMaster Bedroom: Spacious Double Bedroom to the front. Complete with fitted Wardrobes. Complemented with an En Suite.\n\nEn Suite: Fitted with corner shower cubicle, Toilet and WHB.\n\nBathroom: Fitted with Bath, Toilet and WHB. Fully Tiled walls and floor.\n\n \n\nOUTSIDE:\n\nOff-road parking to the front.\n\nFully enclosed and child-friendly rear garden with South-west facing aspect. Finished with natural stone paving and garden shed included.\n\nSERVICES:\n\nGas-fired Central heating. Electricity. Mains Water. Mains Sewerage. Fully alarmed. Excellent Broadband.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Ideal starter home in the excellent Blessington Orchard development.\nSpacious bedrooms and excellent living area layout.\nChild-friendly cul-de-sac location.\nWalking distances to Blessington Town centre.\nWide selection of primary school choices and sporting clubs on your door step.\nShort commuting distance to Millennium Business Park Naas, City West Campus and Sandyford Business Park.\nRegular public transport connections to Tallaght and Dublin City Centre."
      },
